Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

**It was never one issue.** [It was two](/kb/incidents/4471/split): the shared parser
([#1](https://github.com/aealvarengal/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/1), 379 reports) and a
separate hint bug on `booking-v3` ([#2](https://github.com/aealvarengal/mega-s01e03-what-it-shows/issues/2),
33 reports). Both are fixed and closed.

<Callout>
Fixed. Two issues, not one — see <a href="/kb/incidents/4471/split">the split</a>.
</Callout>

